WEBVTT

00:11.017 --> 00:14.438
KIRINOSHIMA MIDDLE SCHOOL

00:16.815 --> 00:18.400
Hey, hey, Koyuki.

00:22.362 --> 00:26.283
Hey, who among us is the hottest?

00:26.366 --> 00:27.367
Huh?

00:30.454 --> 00:32.080
You're adorable!

00:32.581 --> 00:35.834
Knock it off, Tatsu. She's flustered.

00:36.668 --> 00:40.922
Don't bother
with their annoying crap, all right?

00:41.006 --> 00:42.174
Okay.

00:44.342 --> 00:45.469
That's sweet!

00:46.344 --> 00:48.305
Sorry, Koyuki.

00:48.388 --> 00:50.599
You're so tiny,
I didn't even see you there.

00:52.642 --> 00:55.812
Hey, Amano, give her some of your height.

00:57.189 --> 00:58.857
He's so obvious.

00:58.940 --> 01:01.443
- It's plain to see.
- Seriously.

01:03.236 --> 01:04.404
<i>Shorty! Shorty!</i>

01:04.488 --> 01:05.989
<i>Wait, Tiny!</i>

01:07.365 --> 01:09.201
<i>Come on, it's just a joke.</i>

01:09.910 --> 01:11.912
<i>I've been thinking this for a long time.</i>

01:11.995 --> 01:15.499
<i>Igarashi totally has</i>
<i>a crush on you, Koyuki!</i>

01:15.582 --> 01:18.668
<i>Even Tatsu's into you, Koyuki.</i>

01:18.752 --> 01:20.253
<i>I'm jealous.</i>

01:20.754 --> 01:24.049
<i>Why is teasing acceptable</i>
<i>when it's a joke or well-meant?</i>

01:35.477 --> 01:38.230
<i>Tell me. What about my feelings?</i>

01:46.404 --> 01:48.031
MEITEN HIGH SCHOOL

01:48.114 --> 01:50.575
Mari, Muko, and Mei.

01:52.369 --> 01:54.746
Okay, everyone's coming.

01:54.830 --> 01:57.749
We'll throw a snack party
on the last day of the finals!

01:57.833 --> 01:59.417
Woo-hoo!

02:00.210 --> 02:01.336
What should we get?

02:01.419 --> 02:02.754
What sounds good?

02:02.838 --> 02:04.422
Class 5 is so lucky.

02:05.006 --> 02:07.050
Azumi's a literal goddess.

02:07.134 --> 02:10.929
She even greets nerdy introverts like us.
She's heaven-sent.

02:12.681 --> 02:13.682
Hey.

02:14.182 --> 02:15.267
- Huh?
- Huh?

02:18.270 --> 02:19.271
Here.

02:20.730 --> 02:24.442
The teacher wanted me to give it to you.

02:28.155 --> 02:30.574
Thank you very much.

02:34.452 --> 02:35.954
- Scary.
- Scary.

02:36.580 --> 02:37.789
Who was she?

02:37.873 --> 02:39.416
She's Koyuki Hikawa.

02:39.499 --> 02:41.001
People call her "the Queen."

02:41.084 --> 02:42.419
"The Queen"?

02:42.502 --> 02:44.504
She doesn't hang out
with anyone in the class.

02:44.588 --> 02:46.339
That was my first interaction
with her ever.

02:46.423 --> 02:47.966
But the second semester's almost over.

02:48.049 --> 02:50.969
I mean, she's always in a bad mood.

02:51.052 --> 02:53.430
She gives off a "don't come near me" vibe.

02:58.059 --> 03:00.896
Miki, when you make the call,
everyone joins in.

03:00.979 --> 03:02.230
It's not like that.

03:02.314 --> 03:04.232
As expected from Class 5's idol.

03:04.816 --> 03:06.610
Oh, stop.

03:33.762 --> 03:35.263
<i>Winter is already here.</i>

03:36.097 --> 03:38.892
<i>The second semester is coming to a close.</i>

03:39.726 --> 03:42.604
<i>Once the third semester ends,</i>
<i>so will the first year of my high school.</i>

03:44.147 --> 03:47.567
<i>Without anything really happening.</i>

03:51.196 --> 03:54.449
<i>Still, this is far better</i>
<i>than middle school.</i>

03:59.537 --> 04:02.832
<i>It's not that I care</i>
<i>how people see me at this point,</i>

04:03.333 --> 04:05.877
<i>but it still bothered me</i>
<i>when he made that face.</i>

04:06.544 --> 04:09.506
<i>What do they find so scary about me?</i>

04:10.465 --> 04:11.466
<i>Is it my face?</i>

04:13.927 --> 04:15.303
<i>My facial muscles…</i>

04:17.681 --> 04:18.723
Huh?

04:28.233 --> 04:29.609
My bad, my bad.

04:30.318 --> 04:32.070
I was curious what you were doing.

04:32.696 --> 04:34.948
What are you doing, Minato?

04:35.031 --> 04:36.283
Hey, Yota.

04:37.033 --> 04:38.201
Hey!

04:38.285 --> 04:41.162
Why are you picking on a girl?
You're the worst.

04:41.246 --> 04:42.372
It's not like that.

04:42.956 --> 04:45.083
You good? Can you stand up?

04:46.793 --> 04:47.794
Thanks.

04:48.295 --> 04:49.337
<i>Wait.</i>

04:53.925 --> 04:54.926
<i>He's massive!</i>

04:56.720 --> 05:00.265
Sorry about this little rascal
causing you trouble.

05:00.348 --> 05:02.517
I said I didn't do anything.

05:02.600 --> 05:04.269
Is that right?

05:04.352 --> 05:06.771
What do you think I am?

05:07.564 --> 05:10.525
Hikawa, I thought you were more reserved,

05:11.026 --> 05:13.778
- but you can make some funny faces.
- What?

05:13.862 --> 05:15.947
Sorry I startled you.

05:17.824 --> 05:19.117
Well, see you later.

05:27.334 --> 05:28.376
<i>My name…</i>

05:28.460 --> 05:29.461
<i>How…</i>

05:30.045 --> 05:32.339
<i>Who was he, anyway?</i>

07:03.513 --> 07:07.934
EPISODE 1
LINES AND WALLS

07:08.977 --> 07:12.605
I saw this on a live stream yesterday.
Did you know it's gone viral?

07:12.689 --> 07:13.982
I had no idea.

07:14.065 --> 07:15.400
<i>She totally took my seat.</i>

07:15.483 --> 07:16.609
It's at convenience stores.

07:16.693 --> 07:17.694
KOYUKI'S DESK

07:17.777 --> 07:18.778
KOYUKI'S SCALE

07:18.862 --> 07:20.780
EFFORT TO SPEAK UP
EFFORT TO WAIT IT OUT

07:20.864 --> 07:21.865
THUMP

07:21.948 --> 07:23.450
<i>It's fine. I can wait.</i>

07:31.374 --> 07:33.710
Sorry, you want your desk back, right?
I'll move.

07:33.793 --> 07:35.128
GRADE 1 CLASS 2

07:35.795 --> 07:37.005
You don't have to.

07:39.132 --> 07:40.967
AWKWARD VIBE

07:44.053 --> 07:46.473
Say, Hikawa, I'm really sorry.

07:46.556 --> 07:47.557
Huh?

07:48.975 --> 07:50.059
For what?

07:53.229 --> 07:55.857
<i>Did she do something</i>
<i>she needs to apologize for?</i>

08:04.908 --> 08:05.909
MIKI

08:05.992 --> 08:07.327
<i>Have you left already, Koyun?</i>

08:08.870 --> 08:09.871
<i>Not yet.</i>

08:09.954 --> 08:11.206
<i>I'm still at the entrance.</i>

08:11.706 --> 08:13.833
<i>I don't have work today.</i>
<i>Let's walk home together.</i>

08:14.334 --> 08:15.627
<i>Woo-hoo!</i>

08:15.710 --> 08:17.003
<i>Okey froggy!</i>

08:17.086 --> 08:18.338
<i>I'll wait for you out front.</i>

08:18.421 --> 08:19.422
<i>I'll be there soon.</i>

08:20.048 --> 08:22.550
<i>Ten, nine, eight…</i>

08:22.634 --> 08:23.635
<i>Huh? Countdown?</i>

08:23.718 --> 08:24.844
- <i>…seven…</i>
- <i>Hey!</i>

08:24.928 --> 08:26.137
<i>Wait up!</i>

08:32.060 --> 08:33.978
<i>…six, five,</i>

08:34.062 --> 08:35.980
<i>four, three,</i>

08:36.064 --> 08:37.482
<i>two,</i>

08:37.565 --> 08:38.608
<i>one…</i>

08:38.691 --> 08:39.817
Koyun!

08:49.911 --> 08:51.329
I made it!

08:55.833 --> 08:58.086
Was that funny? Was it?

08:58.169 --> 09:00.588
Who takes it that seriously?

09:00.672 --> 09:02.131
Right? I'm amazing, huh?

09:02.215 --> 09:04.300
That was my best record for the day.

09:06.511 --> 09:08.805
You're such a dummy.

09:10.765 --> 09:12.517
Can I come over after I swing by my place?

09:13.101 --> 09:15.311
Yeah. My mom's not home anyway.

09:15.395 --> 09:19.023
Hold on! You ignored me when
we passed by in the hallway yesterday!

09:19.607 --> 09:23.027
I mean, there was nothing
I wanted to talk about.

09:23.111 --> 09:25.113
That's what I mean!

09:25.780 --> 09:27.282
Look at Azumi go.

09:27.865 --> 09:30.702
Her social skills must be crazy,
pushing the Queen around.

09:34.622 --> 09:35.623
201 - HIKAWA
401 - AZUMI

09:35.707 --> 09:37.542
They're all good girls.

09:38.126 --> 09:40.295
I like them and all, but…

09:40.920 --> 09:44.048
I'm like, what?
People treat me like an idol!

09:44.841 --> 09:47.844
<i>They think I'm a saint or something.</i>

09:49.053 --> 09:50.054
How come?

09:50.138 --> 09:52.432
People oughta treat me like a gorilla,
like they used to!

09:52.515 --> 09:53.808
READ BEAN SOUP - STEEL CAN

09:53.891 --> 09:56.561
Insult me more!

09:57.145 --> 09:59.897
Honestly speaking, I wanna joke around,
get up to dumb things,

09:59.981 --> 10:01.941
and make everyone laugh every day!

10:02.025 --> 10:05.695
I want to make the audience go wild!

10:07.155 --> 10:10.617
You should act like this
in front of your classmates.

10:11.117 --> 10:12.452
Be yourself.

10:12.535 --> 10:15.705
It's not like I'm not being myself, but…

10:16.205 --> 10:17.749
How do I put it?

10:17.832 --> 10:21.961
Even if I want to, I can't switch
to being myself immediately.

10:22.629 --> 10:25.632
<i>Before I know it,</i>
<i>I'm in that mode in that classroom.</i>

10:25.715 --> 10:29.552
<i>It's like who I really am</i>
<i>never even existed.</i>

10:29.636 --> 10:30.720
<i>Actually,</i>

10:32.263 --> 10:34.432
what's the real me?

10:35.141 --> 10:37.477
I don't know what I'm feeling anymore.

10:41.814 --> 10:44.359
Mi… ki?

10:45.943 --> 10:48.863
Crap, crap, crap!
I just got super poetic now.

10:48.946 --> 10:52.825
No, no, no!
That was definitely not the real me!

10:54.619 --> 10:55.828
You'll be fine.

10:56.913 --> 10:59.123
Whether you're an idol or a gorilla,

10:59.207 --> 11:01.334
some people will want to stick by you.

11:02.502 --> 11:06.381
People who weren't meant for you won't,
but there's nothing wrong with that.

11:06.923 --> 11:08.466
Koyun…

11:08.549 --> 11:09.717
Me,

11:10.968 --> 11:15.348
I prefer to be alone
than be around people I don't vibe with.

11:16.683 --> 11:18.893
You're fine not talking to anyone all day?

11:18.976 --> 11:19.977
I'd die!

11:20.061 --> 11:21.687
Yep, that's how you are.

11:22.188 --> 11:26.359
I want the strength
to be alone like you, Koyun.

11:27.068 --> 11:30.863
I'm not saying I'm right.

11:31.531 --> 11:34.784
Someone who can put others ahead
of themselves is wonderful.

11:37.537 --> 11:39.622
But if you're suffering, you should stop.

11:42.208 --> 11:44.127
<i>Even someone as social as Miki</i>

11:44.710 --> 11:49.298
<i>thinks they are different</i>
<i>from how others see them.</i>

11:50.466 --> 11:53.803
It's no good!
All this thinking's going nowhere.

11:53.886 --> 11:55.763
Let's get our exam prep underway.

11:56.514 --> 11:58.266
Yeah, that's a good idea.

11:58.349 --> 12:01.561
To start, tell me
what's covered on the English exam.

12:02.770 --> 12:03.771
We're starting there?

12:12.155 --> 12:15.032
<i>I love the classroom early in the morning.</i>

12:15.908 --> 12:18.035
<i>Vocabulary book, vocabulary book…</i>

12:20.371 --> 12:21.747
GRADE 1 CLASS 5 NUMBER 1
MIKI AZUMI

12:21.831 --> 12:23.291
<i>This is Miki's.</i>

12:24.959 --> 12:27.628
<i>That's right, we studied together</i>
<i>at my place yesterday.</i>

12:28.671 --> 12:31.340
<i>She'll probably need it for her class.</i>
<i>I have to give it back to her.</i>

12:32.216 --> 12:33.217
GRADE 1 CLASS 5

12:33.301 --> 12:36.888
<i>I bet Miki's not even at school yet.</i>
<i>I'll leave it in her desk.</i>

12:40.224 --> 12:41.392
Huh?

12:47.523 --> 12:48.566
Huh?

12:49.567 --> 12:50.568
What?

12:59.160 --> 13:00.620
I got you.

13:01.120 --> 13:03.414
<i>That surprised me!</i>

13:04.040 --> 13:05.166
Are you okay?

13:05.833 --> 13:08.252
<i>It's the guy from the other day.</i>

13:09.504 --> 13:10.796
Huh?

13:10.880 --> 13:13.925
<i>Huh? What? Wait, wait, wait, wait!</i>

13:14.842 --> 13:18.471
<i>What on earth is happening?</i>

13:20.973 --> 13:23.726
Koyuki, feed Mr. Giraffe.

13:34.529 --> 13:36.614
You're the girl from before.

13:37.156 --> 13:38.157
Yeah.

13:38.241 --> 13:42.078
I don't have my contacts in today.
I couldn't tell it was you.

13:42.161 --> 13:44.664
Sorry I bumped into you. Are you okay?

13:48.209 --> 13:50.878
<i>I had a flashback just now.</i>

13:51.587 --> 13:52.630
What's this?

13:56.008 --> 13:57.260
Are you a friend of Miki's?

13:58.594 --> 13:59.637
Yes.

14:00.471 --> 14:01.472
<i>Miki?</i>

14:01.973 --> 14:03.933
Might you be in Class 5?

14:04.642 --> 14:06.602
Nope. I'm in Class 6.

14:06.686 --> 14:10.398
I came to grab a textbook
I lent to a friend.

14:11.107 --> 14:12.900
- Here.
- Thank you.

14:13.651 --> 14:16.279
I'm here to return this to Miki.

14:19.448 --> 14:23.160
- I don't know where she sits.
- Are you serious?

14:24.495 --> 14:27.081
Let's see. This should be her desk.

14:27.164 --> 14:29.917
- Should?
- I'm kidding. It definitely is.

14:30.585 --> 14:32.628
Wanna scribble a message on her desk?

14:33.129 --> 14:35.298
Something like, "I brought your notebook."

14:35.381 --> 14:37.550
It's fine. I'll send her a message.

14:38.259 --> 14:40.136
That's one way to go.

14:40.219 --> 14:42.555
I wrote a ton on my friend's desk.

14:43.139 --> 14:45.474
Like, "I grabbed my textbook."

14:47.727 --> 14:50.438
<i>He seems like a mellow guy.</i>

14:50.980 --> 14:52.106
See you.

14:52.690 --> 14:54.525
Thank you.

14:54.609 --> 14:56.736
Let's ace the exam.

15:00.156 --> 15:01.532
Himuro.

15:02.909 --> 15:05.286
<i>Himuro isn't my name.</i>

15:05.369 --> 15:06.537
HIKAWA

15:07.246 --> 15:11.125
<i>Oh, well.</i>
<i>We hardly ever run into each other anyway.</i>

15:23.804 --> 15:24.972
<i>Peaceful.</i>

15:25.056 --> 15:26.057
<i>Quiet.</i>

15:26.724 --> 15:27.934
<i>That's enough for me.</i>

15:32.355 --> 15:35.942
<i>Why do men like to hang out in groups?</i>

15:36.609 --> 15:38.110
<i>Well, I guess it depends on the person.</i>

15:39.695 --> 15:44.075
<i>He was with the person</i>
<i>who's like a giraffe.</i>

15:45.201 --> 15:46.285
<i>They're in the same grade.</i>

15:46.369 --> 15:47.370
GRADE 1 - GRADE 2 - GRADE 3

15:47.453 --> 15:48.621
THE SLIPPER COLOR IS DIFFERENT
BY GRADE

15:49.580 --> 15:52.375
<i>I've tried not to pay attention</i>
<i>to my surroundings until now.</i>

15:53.000 --> 15:57.797
<i>Things like who's in my grade</i>
<i>never mattered to me.</i>

16:03.010 --> 16:04.011
<i>Crap.</i>

16:04.095 --> 16:05.471
<i>We made eye contact…</i>

16:05.554 --> 16:07.264
<i>I think? Maybe?</i>

16:10.685 --> 16:14.146
<i>I looked away without thinking.</i>
<i>It was kind of awkward.</i>

16:14.647 --> 16:17.441
<i>But I don't know him well enough</i>
<i>to go say hi.</i>

16:20.444 --> 16:21.779
<i>Oh, well.</i>

16:22.446 --> 16:25.032
<i>Milk tea, or…</i>

16:25.741 --> 16:27.618
<i>Chocolate milk sounds good too.</i>

16:27.702 --> 16:29.036
<i>Definitely pass.</i>

16:29.704 --> 16:30.705
Hey.

16:32.623 --> 16:34.500
Why did you ignore me?

16:35.751 --> 16:37.128
Ignore you?

16:37.211 --> 16:39.296
I waved but you ran away.

16:39.922 --> 16:41.132
Huh? You waved?

16:42.133 --> 16:43.300
What a shock!

16:44.301 --> 16:45.636
I'm sorry.

16:45.720 --> 16:46.846
<i>I guess?</i>

16:47.346 --> 16:49.557
I didn't even notice.

16:49.640 --> 16:51.726
I wasn't trying to be mean.

16:52.309 --> 16:53.561
Yup, I know.

16:54.061 --> 16:55.563
- Huh?
- Your drink.

16:58.149 --> 17:00.317
AUTHENTIC CURRY DRINK

17:00.901 --> 17:02.611
Do you like it?

17:02.695 --> 17:05.072
No, I got the wrong one.

17:05.156 --> 17:08.075
It's totally my fault then. My bad.

17:08.659 --> 17:12.413
<i>He doesn't seem like a bad person, but…</i>

17:13.622 --> 17:16.751
<i>When someone is this different from me…</i>

17:16.834 --> 17:18.169
Heya!

17:18.961 --> 17:22.590
<i>…I can't help but be wary and suspicious.</i>

17:23.674 --> 17:26.177
<i>Besides, who are you anyway?</i>

17:27.344 --> 17:28.429
Hey!

17:29.013 --> 17:30.931
What're you up to, Amamiya?

17:31.849 --> 17:32.933
Amamiya?

17:33.642 --> 17:36.687
That's me. I'm Minato Amamiya.

17:37.271 --> 17:38.522
Good to meet you.

17:39.231 --> 17:40.608
Likewise.

17:40.691 --> 17:42.610
Wait. You're introducing yourself now?

17:42.693 --> 17:43.694
Are you hitting on her?

17:43.778 --> 17:45.112
What's going on?

17:46.280 --> 17:50.034
Isn't he overly friendly?

17:50.117 --> 17:51.827
You've gotta keep your guard up.

17:51.911 --> 17:53.329
Just kidding.

17:53.913 --> 17:55.372
Give it a rest.

17:55.456 --> 17:58.959
- Get back over there. Shoo.
- <i>So that's their vibe.</i>

17:59.043 --> 18:00.044
Gosh.

18:00.544 --> 18:03.339
<i>I really can't stand it.</i>

18:03.923 --> 18:05.091
Huh?

18:11.680 --> 18:13.557
<i>What's he doing out of the blue?</i>

18:15.434 --> 18:18.312
<i>I know what this is. He's teasing me.</i>

18:18.938 --> 18:20.773
MIND THEATER
WHAT TO DO WHEN YOU GET TEASED

18:20.856 --> 18:22.608
<i>What's the correct response?</i>

18:22.691 --> 18:24.318
<i>One, get worked up.</i>

18:25.277 --> 18:26.362
I'm fuming!

18:26.445 --> 18:27.905
<i>Two, act flustered.</i>

18:27.988 --> 18:29.615
Knock it off, hey.

18:30.366 --> 18:31.742
<i>Three, laugh it off.</i>

18:31.826 --> 18:33.285
That's hilarious.

18:34.578 --> 18:35.871
<i>For now…</i>

18:40.000 --> 18:41.877
<i>I'll give him a smile.</i>

18:41.961 --> 18:43.629
<i>Three, laugh it off. Ha ha ha.</i>

18:50.928 --> 18:53.889
My gosh, she creeps me out.

18:53.973 --> 18:58.227
Hold on, did she get mad
because I butted in?

18:58.727 --> 19:00.020
I'm sure that wasn't it.

19:03.399 --> 19:05.192
<i>That felt more like</i>

19:05.818 --> 19:08.279
<i>she put up a wall.</i>

19:18.622 --> 19:21.917
Hey, Amano, give her some of your height.

19:22.001 --> 19:23.377
Okay.

19:24.587 --> 19:26.505
Koyuki.

19:32.761 --> 19:35.931
Koyuki, do you like Igarashi?

19:42.021 --> 19:43.814
Did you see it?

19:43.898 --> 19:45.816
It was so funny.

19:46.317 --> 19:47.443
Seriously.

19:51.530 --> 19:53.949
I'm sorry, Koyuki.

20:05.044 --> 20:06.962
Don't get cocky.

21:58.824 --> 22:00.492
MIKI: I'M SORRY KOYUN!

22:00.576 --> 22:03.454
HR IS GOING ON FOREVER - IT'LL
BE A WHILE BEFORE I CAN LEAVE

22:03.537 --> 22:05.164
YOU KNOW WHERE
THE COMMUNITY CENTER IS?

22:05.247 --> 22:06.498
IF YOU DO, WAIT FOR ME THERE…

22:07.124 --> 22:08.334
I see.

22:09.293 --> 22:11.962
Hey, hey! Are you by yourself?

22:12.046 --> 22:13.088
I'm not.

22:13.172 --> 22:15.841
Whatever! You're funny.

22:15.924 --> 22:17.259
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

22:18.218 --> 22:19.386
<i>Why?</i>

22:19.470 --> 22:22.431
<i>Why do people come onto me</i>
<i>like this when I'm not at school?</i>

22:24.600 --> 22:25.768
Wait up.

22:27.478 --> 22:30.481
It's all right. We don't bite.

22:30.981 --> 22:33.317
Look who's talking.

22:34.485 --> 22:37.112
- I am.
- <i>This kind of vibe.</i>

22:39.990 --> 22:41.617
<i>I really, really can't stand it.</i>

22:42.993 --> 22:44.161
<i>Oh, no.</i>

22:44.745 --> 22:45.871
<i>I have to get away.</i>

22:56.173 --> 22:57.841
<i>What's his name again?</i>

22:58.967 --> 23:00.344
What's this out of the blue?

23:01.011 --> 23:02.012
NOW THINKING

23:04.431 --> 23:06.183
- Hey, what's her deal?
- Maybe she knows him.

23:08.644 --> 23:09.770
<i>He noticed--</i>

23:11.980 --> 23:13.398
<i>His terrible vision!</i>

23:16.735 --> 23:17.945
<i>He left.</i>

23:18.529 --> 23:20.697
He ignored you!

23:21.949 --> 23:23.492
Join us for a good time.

23:23.575 --> 23:24.618
No thanks!

23:25.244 --> 23:26.245
<i>What do I even do?</i>

23:26.328 --> 23:27.663
TWO AGAINST ONE
WHAT IF I UPSET THEM

23:27.746 --> 23:28.747
<i>I'm terrified and angry.</i>

23:28.831 --> 23:30.124
THEY'RE MOCKING ME
WHAT A WASTE OF TIME

23:30.707 --> 23:32.126
- <i>How frustrating…</i>
- Let's go.

23:32.209 --> 23:33.418
- Come with us.
- It's gonna be fun.

23:33.502 --> 23:36.004
I said I'm not interested!

23:37.464 --> 23:40.217
I'm serious. Leave me alone.

23:43.220 --> 23:44.263
Bye.

23:46.723 --> 23:48.308
Sorry. You okay?

23:50.310 --> 23:51.645
I thought it was you.

23:52.896 --> 23:53.897
Mr. Giraffe?

23:53.981 --> 23:55.983
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
